@startuml module_dependencies
' Source evidence:
' pom.xml: modules and dependencyManagement
' modules/agent-core/pom.xml: campusclaw-ai dependency
' modules/cron/pom.xml: campusclaw-agent-core dependency
' modules/coding-agent-cli/pom.xml: application dependencies
' Source baseline: ee3fdb4893228045f06b9b1d1b3b3bb505812c73.
' Observed behavior: the baseline Maven reactor contains four Java modules.
' Target architecture: add modules/common and common/constant/ClawConstants.java.
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/utils/CampusClawHome.java baseDir.
' Architecture reason: direct consumers depend on common without reversing the business dependency graph.
' Design reason: CampusClaw is a service product; CLI and TUI are removed.
title CampusClaw Module Dependencies

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "campusclaw-common\nClawConstants" as Common
component "campusclaw-ai" as AI
component "campusclaw-agent-core" as Core
component "campusclaw-cron" as Cron
component "campusclaw-coding-agent\n(Spring Boot service)" as App

AI --> Common
App --> Common
Core --> AI
Cron --> Core
App --> AI
App --> Core
App --> Cron

note bottom of App
Historical directory name: modules/coding-agent-cli
No CLI, TUI, or RPC product entry point
end note
@enduml
